@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
    // Layout = null on purpose: this page must be readable by anyone —
    // parents, and Meta's reviewer — without a session. The dashboard layout
    // needs a logged-in user and pulls the sidebar from the API.
    Layout = null;
}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Privacy Policy - Sir Syed Model High School</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root { --brand: #008649; --ink: #1f2937; --muted: #6b7280; --line: #e5e7eb; }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif;
            color: var(--ink);
            background: #f8fafc;
            line-height: 1.7;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        .wrap { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px 60px; }
        header {
            background: var(--brand);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 34px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        header h1 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; }
        header .sub { font-size: 14px; opacity: .9; margin-top: 4px; }
        .card {
            background: #fff;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 28px 30px;
        }
        h2 {
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--brand);
            margin: 28px 0 10px;
        }
        h2:first-of-type { margin-top: 0; }
        p { margin-bottom: 12px; }
        ul { margin: 0 0 14px 20px; }
        li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .updated { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
        .contact {
            background: #f0fdf4;
            border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 16px 18px;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }
        a { color: var(--brand); }
        footer { text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 26px; }
        @@media (max-width: 600px) { .card { padding: 20px 18px; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Sir Syed Model High School (Boys &amp; Girls)</h1>
        <div class="sub">Chhonawala Road, Hasilpur</div>
    </header>

    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="card">
            <h1 style="font-size:22px;margin-bottom:6px;">Privacy Policy</h1>
            <div class="updated">Last updated: 6 September 2026</div>

            <p>
                This policy explains what information Sir Syed Model High School
                (&ldquo;the School&rdquo;, &ldquo;we&rdquo;) collects through its school management
                system, why we collect it, and who it is shared with. The system is used only
                to run the School; it is not open to the public and is not used for advertising.
            </p>

            <h2>Information we hold</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Students</strong> &mdash; name, date and place of birth, gender, Form-B number, religion, photograph, home address, class and section, roll, registration and admission numbers.</li>
                <li><strong>Parents and guardians</strong> &mdash; name, CNIC, mobile number and occupation of the father, mother or guardian.</li>
                <li><strong>Academic records</strong> &mdash; attendance, examination marks, results and certificates.</li>
                <li><strong>Fee records</strong> &mdash; fees applied, vouchers issued and payments received.</li>
                <li><strong>Staff records</strong> &mdash; employee details, attendance, leave and payroll.</li>
                <li><strong>Messages</strong> &mdash; WhatsApp messages sent to parents by the School, and replies received from them.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                This information is provided by parents or guardians at the time of admission,
                or generated by the School in the ordinary course of teaching and administration.
            </p>

            <h2>How we use it</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Enrolling students and maintaining their academic record.</li>
                <li>Recording attendance and examination results.</li>
                <li>Issuing fee vouchers and recording payments.</li>
                <li>Managing staff attendance and payroll.</li>
                <li>Sending parents notifications about absence, fees, results and school announcements, and answering their replies.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>WhatsApp messaging</h2>
            <p>
                The School sends notifications over WhatsApp using the WhatsApp Business Platform
                provided by Meta Platforms, Inc. To deliver a message, the recipient&rsquo;s mobile
                number and the content of that message pass through Meta&rsquo;s systems and are
                handled under
                <a href="https://www.whatsapp.com/legal/business-data-transfer-addendum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp&rsquo;s own terms</a>.
                Replies sent by parents to the School&rsquo;s WhatsApp number are stored in the
                system so staff can read and answer them.
            </p>
            <p>
                Parents may ask the School at any time to stop sending them WhatsApp messages.
                Doing so does not affect their child&rsquo;s enrolment.
            </p>

            <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
            <p>We do not sell personal information and we do not use it for advertising. It is shared only with:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Meta Platforms</strong> &mdash; solely to deliver and receive the WhatsApp messages described above.</li>
                <li><strong>Google Drive</strong> &mdash; where the School has enabled off-site database backups, encrypted copies are stored in an account controlled by the School.</li>
                <li><strong>Government or regulatory bodies</strong> &mdash; where the School is required by law to provide records.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
            <p>
                Student and academic records are kept for as long as the student is enrolled and
                afterwards as part of the School&rsquo;s permanent records, as school regulations
                require. Fee and payroll records are kept as long as required for accounting.
                WhatsApp conversations are kept so staff have the history of what was said to a family.
            </p>

            <h2>How it is protected</h2>
            <p>
                The system is served only over an encrypted HTTPS connection. Access requires a
                username and password, and each member of staff sees only what their role permits.
                Backups are held in accounts controlled by the School.
            </p>

            <h2>Children&rsquo;s information</h2>
            <p>
                Much of this information concerns children. It is collected from their parents or
                guardians under the School&rsquo;s authority, and is used only to educate and care
                for the student. It is never shared for marketing.
            </p>

            <h2>Your rights</h2>
            <p>
                Parents and guardians may ask to see the information the School holds about their
                child, have anything incorrect corrected, or ask for it to be deleted. Requests to
                delete are described on our
                <a href="/data-deletion">Data Deletion</a> page. Contact the School office using
                the details below and we will respond within 30 days.
            </p>

            <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
            <p>
                If this policy changes we will update this page and the date shown at the top.
            </p>

            <h2>Contact us</h2>
            <div class="contact">
                <strong>Sir Syed Model High School (Boys &amp; Girls)</strong><br />
                Chhonawala Road, Hasilpur, Pakistan<br />
                Phone: 0333-6335634 &nbsp;|&nbsp; 0301-7330101<br />
                Email: <a href="mailto:ssmhschools@gmail.com">ssmhschools@gmail.com</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer>&copy; @DateTime.Now.Year Sir Syed Model High School</footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
